  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"745\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\" height=\"256\" rowspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"115\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"90\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/l_bar_logo_2.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"/site/skill/newbie_history/\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/left_menu/n_history.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:110/20\" width=\"110\"></a></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/newbie_i/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/n_i.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/newbie_make/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/n_m.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/newbie_l/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/n_l.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/newbie_faq/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/n_faq.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/newbie_f/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/n_f.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/newbie_m/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/left_menu/n_ma.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:110/20\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/newbie_meet/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/n_meet.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/newbie_j/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/n_j.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/newbie_s/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/left_menu/n_app.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:110/20\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"5\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/n_line.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></p>\n</td>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"627\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"20\" width=\"627\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>&nbsp;</b></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>로긴 및 캐릭만들기</b></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"39\" width=\"630\"><ul>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>[ 울티마 온라인 게임에 \n                접속하는 방법 ] </b><br>\n<br> a. 인터넷 접속<br> <br> b. 바탕화면에 있는 Ultima Online \n                아이콘을 더블클릭하거나 시작 &gt;&gt; 프로그램 &gt;&gt; Ultima \n                Online &gt;&gt; Ultima Online을 클릭 <br> <br> c. UO Server \n                접속 : 'OK' 클릭 <br></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/login01.jpg\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"194\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:396/194\" width=\"396\"></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">d. Auto Patch 받는 화면 \n                : 패치(Patch) 받기 종료 후 'OK' 클릭 </font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"167\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/login02.jpg\" width=\"355\"></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">e. 울티마 온라인 게임 \n                접속 화면 : Account Name에 자신의 계정 이름을 입력 </font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Password에 \n                비밀번호 입력 후 ▶ 를 클릭 </font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"313\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/login03.jpg\" width=\"400\"></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">f. 사용할 샤드(Server)를 \n                선택[여기서 샤드란 각각의 컴퓨터 서버라고 생각하심됩니다]</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/login05.jpg\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"313\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:400/313\" width=\"400\"></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">g.캐릭터에 지정할 직업 \n                고르기<br></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">고급으로 들어가시면 스킬3가지를 \n                고르실수 잇습니다.</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"313\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/character01.jpg\" width=\"400\"></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">h. 각각의 직업에 대한 \n                스킬 지정하기 </font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"313\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/character02.jpg\" width=\"400\"></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">i.캐릭터의 이름 정하기 \n                <br></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"313\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/character03.jpg\" width=\"400\"></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">j. 지도 보기 : ▶ 클릭</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">처음 시작할수 있는 원하는 \n                마을을 지정합니다.</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"313\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/character12.jpg\" width=\"400\"></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">k. 게임 접속 화면 : 'OK' \n                클릭</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/play01.jpg\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"313\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:400/313\" width=\"400\"></font></p>\n</ul>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><span><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>출처 : EA코리아</b></font></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"20\" width=\"627\"><p align=\"right\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/site/skill/newbie_l/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/top.gif\" width=\"50\"></b></font></a></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n",
